"plain":"BOWMEN AT NORTH BANK WEST, STRENGTH 64. SEEN: RHINO HORSE, ORCHID FIRST FOOT.","cipher":null},{"seq":1086,"t":6300,"type":"courier","id":"c370","house":"tiger","letter":"L431","kind":"report","to":"tiger-camp","path":["F1","s-west","s-mid","south-village","tiger-camp"],"depart":6300,"plain":"HORSE AT WEST FORD, STRENGTH 60. SEEN: RHINO HORSE, ORCHID FIRST FOOT, ORCHID HORSE.","cipher":null},{"seq":1087,"t":6300,"type":"model","house":"rhino","model":"local:local","tokens":1900,"retries":0},{"seq":1088,"t":6300,"type":"thought","house":"rhino","text":"Watch 22. My doctrine says take the middle ford in the first five watches and hold it. I hold F2. I should reinforce F2 with my archers and inf. Tiger has forces near F1/F2. Orchid has forces near F1/F2. I should hunt enemy riders as per doctrine. I'll move my cavalry to hunt any"},{"seq":1089,"t":6300,"type":"courier","id":"c371","house":"rhino","letter":"L433","kind":"order","to":"rhino-inf-1","path":["rhino-camp","north-village","n-mid","F2"],"depart":6300,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, MARCH TO NORTH BANK MIDDLE.","cipher":null},{"seq":1090,"t":6300,"type":"courier","id":"c372","house":"rhino","letter":"L434","kind":"order","to":"rhino-arch-1","path":["rhino-camp","north-village","n-mid"],"depart":6300,"plain":"BOWMEN, HOLD AT MIDDLE FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1091,"t":6300,"type":"courier","id":"c373","house":"rhino","letter":"L435","kind":"order","to":"rhino-cav-1","path":["rhino-camp","n-west"],"depart":6300,"plain":"HORSE, MARCH TO NORTH BANK WEST.","cipher":null},{"seq":1092,"t":6300,"type":"model","house":"kite","model":"local:local","tokens":1602,"retries":0},{"seq":1093,"t":6300,"type":"thought","house":"kite","text":"Watch 22. Doctrine dictates taking East Ford (F3) early and holding it. Kite forces are at F3 (East Ford). Since no enemy is seen, I must consolidate and prepare for the last charge. I will reinforce F3 with my remaining units (assuming they are at kite-camp) to ensure I hold it,"},{"seq":1094,"t":6300,"type":"courier","id":"c374","house":"kite","letter":"L436","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-1","path":["kite-camp","n-east","F3"],"depart":6300,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT EAST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1095,"t":6300,"type":"courier","id":"c375","house":"kite","letter":"L437","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-2","path":["kite-camp","n-east","F3"],"depart":6300,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, HOLD AT EAST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1096,"t":6300,"type":"model","house":"orchid","model":"local:local","tokens":1730,"retries":0},{"seq":1097,"t":6300,"type":"thought","house":"orchid","text":"Rhino and Tiger are active near F1 and F2. Orchid needs to solidify its positions and react to threats. I'll reinforce F1 with foot and use archers to harass nearby enemies, while keeping the main body ready to respond."},{"seq":1098,"t":6300,"type":"courier","id":"c376","house":"orchid","letter":"L438","kind":"order","to":"orchid-inf-1","path":["orchid-camp","s-west"],"depart":6300,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT WEST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1099,"t":6300,"type":"courier","id":"c377","house":"orchid","letter":"L439","kind":"order","to":"orchid-arch-1","path":["orchid-camp","s-west","F1","n-west"],"depart":6300,"plain":"BOWMEN, HOLD AT WEST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1100,"t":6300,"type":"courier","id":"c378","house":"orchid","letter":"L440","kind":"order","to":"orchid-inf-2","path":["orchid-camp","south-village","s-mid"],"depart":6300,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, MARCH TO SOUTH BANK MIDDLE.","cipher":null},{"seq":1101,"t":6300,"type":"model","house":"tiger","model":"local:local","tokens":1882,"retries":0},{"seq":1102,"t":6300,"type":"thought","house":"tiger","text":"It is Watch 22. My doctrine says take F1 and make a friend. Orchid seems active near F1/F2/F3. I should try to reinforce F1 and scout/pressure Orchid. I'll move my infantry to F1 to secure it, and send a cipher letter to Orchid to offer a truce."},{"seq":1103,"t":6300,"type":"courier","id":"c379","house":"tiger","letter":"L441","kind":"order","to":"tiger-inf-1","path":["tiger-camp","south-village","s-mid","s-west","F1"],"depart":6600,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, MARCH TO WEST FORD.","cipher":"ECNOQ EKKQ, HSNRB QK WPOQ EKNI."},{"seq":1104,"t":6300,"type":"courier","id":"c380","house":"tiger","letter":"L442","kind":"order","to":"tiger-inf-2","path":["tiger-camp","south-village"],"depart":6600,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, MARCH TO SOUTH BANK WEST.","cipher":"OPRKJI EKKQ, HSNRB QK OKUQB TSJF WPOQ."},{"seq":1105,"t":6300,"type":"courier","id":"c381","house":"tiger","letter":"L443","kind":"letter","to":"orchid-camp","path":["tiger-camp","south-village","orchid-camp"],"depart":6600,"plain":"TRUCE","cipher":"QNURP"},{"seq":1106,"t":6305,"type":"caught","courier":"c369","letter":"L430","house":"tiger","by":"rhino-cav-1","x":200,"y":446},{"seq":1107,"t":6309,"type":"delivered","courier":"c346","letter":"L405","house":"rhino"},{"seq":1108,"t":6314,"type":"delivered","courier":"c345","letter":"L404","house":"tiger"},{"seq":1109,"t":6314,"type":"caught","courier":"c370","letter":"L431","house":"tiger","by":"orchid-inf-1","x":200,"y":519},{"seq":1110,"t":6331,"type":"clash","a":"orchid-inf-1","b":"tiger-cav-1","x":200,"y":500},{"seq":1111,"t":6331,"type":"clash","a":"tiger-inf-1","b":"orchid-inf-1","x":200,"y":525},{"seq":1112,"t":6331,"type":"clash","a":"tiger-cav-1","b":"orchid-inf-1","x":200,"y":525},{"seq":1113,"t":6337,"type":"caught","courier":"c367","letter":"L428","house":"tiger","by":"orchid-inf-1","x":200,"y":548},{"seq":1114,"t":6384,"type":"rout","squad":"rhino-cav-1"},{"seq":1115,"t":6416,"type":"delivered","courier":"c366","letter":"L426","house":"orchid"},{"seq":1116,"t":6416,"type":"intel","house":"orchid","letter":"L373","from":"tiger","text":"______, ____ __ ____ ____.","plain":false},{"seq":1117,"t":6416,"type":"delivered","courier":"c373","letter":"L435","house":"rhino"},{"seq":1118,"t":6422,"type":"delivered","courier":"c358","letter":"L417","house":"rhino"},{"seq":1119,"t":6441,"type":"delive